  "body": "## Changelog\n### New Features\n* d460d1b362871a19402ce5b2a9f06e76f377b288: feat(scopes): allow custom scopes and prefixes (@stefanlogue)\n### Bug fixes\n* 1226c756322db28ea7180a0e036c9c0760671449: refactor(main): pull some functions out of main to test (@stefanlogue)\n### Documentation updates\n* 243f3a4492321b97003c7f281f031a357f19da89: docs(prefixes): update readme (@stefanlogue)\n### Build process updates\n* 643f2f6cc5034177d467f39e210a3bca734efc38: ci(homebrew): remove deprecated option (@stefanlogue)\n* 66304ce74c5caf464d385b1d387f1f9144c8d29c: ci(sonar): exclude main file from coverage analysis (@stefanlogue)\n### Other work\n* eaeded365707eb1cef226630845b5c8ae4c4c649: Allow custom scopes and prefixes (#92) (@stefanlogue)\n* 6f50abf7efaa2b6a52581735330fc8196ca43914: Calling conflicts_with formula is deprecated (#86) (@stefanlogue)\n* 25f38953f62616d680621fe6de3bfe6e7e3382ba: test(prefix): add tests for prefix (@stefanlogue)\n* 1b151bd6b8e17956dec245c796b31075169b4c04: test(scopes): add tests for scopes options (@stefanlogue)\n\n",
  "mentions_count": 1
}
